Speaking of: standard Lojban is LfB/CLL Lojban with the xorlo changes.
Nothing else, including dotside, is official, and nothing will even be
considered until the baseline documentation is finished. Last time I looked
there wasn't much left to do, but the amount that *was* left was the same
as the penultimate time I checked.


